{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118303","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118303/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118303/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118303/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118303","id":4224044884,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7QyGtR","number":118303,"title":"Buildsystem: Support clang source based coverage on linux","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","color":"4466ff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-08T11:08:30Z","updated_at":"2026-07-15T15:50:26Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118303","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118303","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118303.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118303.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"The `use_coverage` flag does enable gcov based coverage at the moment. This is supported by clang and gcc and generates data files per object file. So when you need a report to use with other tools (e.g. VSCode plugin) it is necessary to aggregate those data files. For example using a tool like `gcovr`. `gcovr` performs poorly for Godot and aggregating the gcov data takes multiple minutes for me.\r\n\r\nclang has another strategy: [source based coverage](https://clang.llvm.org/docs/SourceBasedCodeCoverage.html). It produces bigger binaries but outputs into a single file. llvm also comes with utilities to generate summaries or export data from this file.\r\n\r\nFor my setup I require an lcov file for use with a VSCode extension and producing this lcov file is much faster when using the llvm utils compared to gcovr.\r\n\r\nThis PR adds an easy way to use clang source based coverage to our scons options. It does break compat of the scons flag, I'm not sure if that is an issue.\r\n\r\nI did not touch the macos flag, since I can't test that and I'm not sure to how to programatically check whether clang is used on mac.\r\n\r\nFor reference here's the workflow to get a summary using this approach:\r\n\r\n```\r\nscons dev_build=yes use_coverage=llvm use_llvm=yes dev_mode=yes linker=mold extra_suffix=cov\r\nLLVM_PROFILE_FILE=\"coverage.profraw\" ./bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.dev.x86_64.llvm.cov --test\r\nllvm-profdata merge --sparse coverage.profraw -o coverage.profdata\r\nllvm-cov report -instr-profile coverage.profdata ./bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.dev.x86_64.llvm.cov -ignore-filename-regex=\"(modules/[^/]+/)?tests/|thirdparty/|.*\\.gen\\.h\" > coverage-report.txt\r\n```\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118303/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118303/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}